<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>AI &amp; Agent 开发者晨报</title><link>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing</link><description>每日 AI 领域精选新闻与深度分析</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 06:49:55 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing/web/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><item><title>爆#阿里Qwen3.8-Max正式开源#</title><link>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/974342/alibaba-qwen-max-open-weight-ai</link><description>阿里今日（2026年8月3日）正式开源Qwen3.8-Max，2.4万亿参数，号称全面超越GPT-4o（被3家来源报道：The Verge、The Decoder、DEV.to）。网友A：国产模型越来越猛了！网友B：2.4T参数，我的显卡瑟瑟发抖。</description><guid>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/974342/alibaba-qwen-max-open-weight-ai</guid><source>The Verge AI</source><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 19:01:11 +0800</pubDate><category>大模型</category><category>开源</category></item><item><title>沸#OpenAI实时语音系统揭秘#</title><link>https://openai.com/index/continuous-voice-interaction-with-gpt-live</link><description>OpenAI发文详解GPT-Live，六个月打造无间断语音交互，采用无轮次语音模型，延迟极低。网友A：终于不用等转圈了。网友B：实时语音才是未来。</description><guid>https://openai.com/index/continuous-voice-interaction-with-gpt-live</guid><source>OpenAI</source><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 15:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>语音</category></item><item><title>沸#EU AI透明度标签今日生效#</title><link>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/974571/eu-ai-act-transparency-labels-rules-deepfakes</link><description>欧盟AI法案规定的AI标签和透明度规则今天（2026年8月3日）起强制执行，企业需标注AI生成内容。网友A：欧洲监管终于落地了。网友B：以后AI水印要成标配了。</description><guid>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/974571/eu-ai-act-transparency-labels-rules-deepfakes</guid><source>The Verge AI</source><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 01:38:45 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>监管</category></item><item><title>热#IBM：92%AI安全事故缺访问控制#</title><link>https://the-decoder.com/ibm-finds-92-of-companies-hit-by-ai-security-breaches-lacked-basic-access-controls/</link><description>IBM报告显示，92%遭遇AI安全事件的公司未实施基本访问控制，建议企业立即加强身份和权限管理。网友A：安全永远是第一位的。网友B：看来AI安全市场要爆发了。</description><guid>https://the-decoder.com/ibm-finds-92-of-companies-hit-by-ai-security-breaches-lacked-basic-access-controls/</guid><source>The Decoder</source><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 23:47:08 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>安全</category></item><item><title>热#商汤开源4K图像模型#</title><link>https://www.qbitai.com/2026/08/465673.html</link><description>商汤发布SenseNova U1.5 Lite，国产开源，直接输出4K分辨率图像，效果惊艳。网友A：国产开源越来越给力。网友B：4K直出，显卡又要升级了。</description><guid>https://www.qbitai.com/2026/08/465673.html</guid><source>量子位</source><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 19:59:32 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>开源</category></item><item><title>热#Trump AI保护主义波及机器人#</title><link>https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/08/03/1141056/trumps-ai-protectionism-has-come-for-robotics/</link><description>MIT Tech Review报道，特朗普的AI保护主义政策已扩展到机器人领域，可能影响全球供应链。网友A：科技脱钩越来越严重。网友B：机器人也要被卡脖子了。</description><guid>https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/08/03/1141056/trumps-ai-protectionism-has-come-for-robotics/</guid><source>MIT Tech Review</source><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 02:43:30 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>政策</category></item><item><title>热#Meta年薪百万抢电工#</title><link>https://www.qbitai.com/2026/08/465223.html</link><description>Meta因数据中心扩张面临电工短缺，开出年薪百万美元并自办技校培养人才。网友A：现在转行当电工还来得及吗？网友B：AI时代，电工成了稀缺资源。</description><guid>https://www.qbitai.com/2026/08/465223.html</guid><source>量子位</source><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 15:11:13 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>基础设施</category></item><item><title>热#AWS助力Superblocks嵌入私有云#</title><link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/03/aws-is-helping-vibe-coding-startup-superblocks-and-the-implications-are-big/</link><description>AWS允许vibe-coding平台Superblocks嵌入私有云，大幅降低AI应用开发门槛。网友A：vibe-coding要起飞了。网友B：AWS这步棋走得妙。</description><guid>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/03/aws-is-helping-vibe-coding-startup-superblocks-and-the-implications-are-big/</guid><source>TechCrunch AI</source><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 04:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>开发工具</category></item><item><title>热#Design Arena融资790万#</title><link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/03/designarena-creators-raise-7-9-million-to-bring-taste-to-ai-models/</link><description>设计平台Design Arena完成790万美元融资，530万用户，旨在用AI模型提升设计品味。网友A：AI审美终于被重视了。网友B：设计师要失业了吗？</description><guid>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/03/designarena-creators-raise-7-9-million-to-bring-taste-to-ai-models/</guid><source>TechCrunch AI</source><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 03:28:57 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>融资</category></item><item><title>#OpenClaw+Ollama构建自主Agent#</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28629</link><description>新论文提出OpenClaw框架结合Ollama，实现完全自主可扩展的AI Agent系统，从反应式迈向自主式。网友A：Agent框架越来越成熟了。网友B：Ollama生态又壮大了。</description><guid>https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28629</guid><source>ArXiv CL</source><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>Ollama</category></item><item><title>#本周AI播客：Opus 5等模型讨论#</title><link>https://lastweekin.ai/p/lwiai-podcast-253-opus-5-gemini-36</link><description>Last Week in AI播客第253期，讨论Anthropic Opus 5、Google Gemini 3.6、Kimi K3及HuggingFace被黑事件。网友A：Opus 5终于有消息了。网友B：HuggingFace被黑影响大。</description><guid>https://lastweekin.ai/p/lwiai-podcast-253-opus-5-gemini-36</guid><source>Last Week in AI</source><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 18:04:18 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>模型动态</category></item><item><title>#F1用Agentic AI加速数据操作#</title><link>https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/from-weeks-to-minutes-how-formula-1-uses-agentic-ai-on-aws-to-accelerate-data-operations/</link><description>一级方程式利用AWS上的Agentic AI，将数据操作时间从数周缩短到几分钟，服务8亿粉丝。网友A：AI在体育领域也大显身手。网友B：F1的技术一直很前沿。</description><guid>https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/from-weeks-to-minutes-how-formula-1-uses-agentic-ai-on-aws-to-accelerate-data-operations/</guid><source>AWS ML Blog</source><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 01:24:15 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>行业应用</category></item><item><title>#RLSVR：LLM自我改进新方法#</title><link>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2084310082762719418</link><description>新论文提出RLSVR，通过任务转换诱导自验证奖励，实现LLM开放式自我改进。网友A：自我改进是通往AGI的关键。网友B：RLVR升级版来了。</description><guid>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2084310082762719418</guid><source>Twitter @_akhaliq</source><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:07:02 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>强化学习</category></item><item><title>#Armature为MCP Agent提供分析#</title><link>https://armature.tech/</link><description>Armature（YC P26）推出产品分析工具，可重建和评估MCP上的Agent会话，类似产品分析+评估。网友A：MCP生态越来越完善。网友B：Agent可观测性终于有工具了。</description><guid>https://armature.tech/</guid><source>HackerNews AI</source><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:17:59 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>开发工具</category></item><item><title>#推理工程大师课：Baseten分享#</title><link>https://www.latent.space/p/inference-eng</link><description>Baseten的Philip Kiely和Ali Taha在Latent Space分享推理工程最佳实践，涵盖模型部署、优化等。网友A：推理工程是AI落地的关键。网友B：Baseten的实践很有价值。</description><guid>https://www.latent.space/p/inference-eng</guid><source>Latent Space</source><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 05:44:03 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>推理</category></item><item><title>#AI评估AI科学家新基准#</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28631</link><description>新论文提出基准测试，让AI系统自动评审AI研究论文，探索AI自我评估能力。网友A：AI科学家要内卷了。网友B：以后审稿人真要失业了。</description><guid>https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28631</guid><source>ArXiv CL</source><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>基准</category></item><item><title>#AI Agent安全部署指南#</title><link>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/08/03/how-to-secure-ai-agents-mcp-servers-and-llm-apps-in-production/</link><description>文章详细介绍了如何在生产中保护AI Agent、MCP服务器和LLM应用，涵盖常见风险和对策。网友A：安全指南必须收藏。网友B：MCP安全是个新领域。</description><guid>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/08/03/how-to-secure-ai-agents-mcp-servers-and-llm-apps-in-production/</guid><source>MarkTechPost</source><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 04:16:56 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>安全</category></item><item><title>#Moonshot PerceptionBench评估教程#</title><link>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/08/03/evaluating-multimodal-vision-models-with-moonshot-perceptionbench-using-robust-data-loading-and-automated-judging/</link><description>教程展示如何使用Moonshot PerceptionBench端到端评估多模态视觉模型，包含数据加载和自动评判。网友A：评估标准越来越重要。网友B：多模态模型需要统一测试。</description><guid>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/08/03/evaluating-multimodal-vision-models-with-moonshot-perceptionbench-using-robust-data-loading-and-automated-judging/</guid><source>MarkTechPost</source><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 06:26:32 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>多模态</category></item><item><title>今日深度分析 - 2026-08-04</title><link>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing</link><description>今日AI圈最炸裂的当属阿里开源2.4万亿参数Qwen3.8-Max，国产模型再进一步；EU AI标签生效和IBM安全报告也引发热议。最虚的可能是Moonshot教程，太技术了吃瓜群众看不懂。整体看，大模型军备竞赛和AI安全合规是主线。</description><guid>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing/daily-analysis/20260804</guid></item></channel></rss>